{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CexH2nBMPmZEfEq3vesoT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019D4yLRj2vMYVaPaS6JysPx","name":"Agent","input":{"description":"Add confirm endpoint to ShipmentController","prompt":"I need you to edit a Kotlin file at `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-cd563cee-8656-45be-b00b-25baabcba43c/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt`.\n\nAdd a new endpoint method `confirm` to the ShipmentController class. The endpoint should:\n1. Be a POST mapping to `/{shipmentId}/confirm`\n2. Accept a shipmentId path parameter\n3. Find the shipment by ID using repository.findById(shipmentId), throwing ResourceNotFoundException if not found\n4. Check the shipment status:\n   - If the status is CREATED, update it to CONFIRMED using repository.save() with the updated shipment\n   - If the status is CONFIRMED, do nothing (idempotent behavior)\n   - If the status is CANCELLED, throw ConflictException with ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE_TRANSITION and message \"Cannot confirm a shipment in CANCELLED status\"\n5. Return the updated (or unchanged) shipment wrapped in ResponseEntity.ok()\n\nAdd this method after the existing `list()` method. Follow the same style and patterns as the existing methods in the controller.\n\nDo NOT modify the existing methods. Only add the new confirm method.\n\nAfter editing, verify the file looks correct with the new method added at the end of the controller class.","run_in_background":false},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":716,"cache_read_input_tokens":15624,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":716,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_011Y5ZWfvAjNan51P3wABDEq","session_id":"24402fd9-b714-4b41-86f7-6f1d1b0b434b","uuid":"f56472a0-e837-44a5-8ed8-04dfdb433394","timestamp":"2026-09-11T20:23:56.666Z","request_id":"req_011CexH2mjK4GbG3u5NnxgrD","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement the confirm shipment endpoint"}
