{"type":"system","subtype":"task_started","task_id":"a57df76e785eb7867","tool_use_id":"toolu_017PxwGXzW6CrHziMy62st7w","description":"Edit Kotlin file to add confirm endpoint method","subagent_type":"general-purpose","is_backgrounded":false,"spawn_depth":3,"task_type":"local_agent","prompt":"I need you to edit a Kotlin file at: `/private/var/folders/jr/lwzz65cx5pndqqdgzhnym1pc0000gn/T/observatory-run-cd563cee-8656-45be-b00b-25baabcba43c/sample-service/src/main/kotlin/com/unityinflow/sample/shipment/ShipmentController.kt`\n\nAdd a new method called `confirm` to the ShipmentController class, placed after the existing `list()` method (which is at the end of the class).\n\nHere is the method code to add (use the exact formatting and indentation shown):\n\n```kotlin\n    @PostMapping(\"/{shipmentId}/confirm\")\n    fun confirm(@PathVariable shipmentId: String): ResponseEntity<Shipment> {\n        val shipment = repository.findById(shipmentId)\n            ?: throw ResourceNotFoundException(\n                ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_NOT_FOUND,\n                \"No shipment with id '$shipmentId'\",\n            )\n\n        return when (shipment.status) {\n            ShipmentStatus.CREATED -> {\n                shipment.status = ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED\n                ResponseEntity.ok(repository.save(shipment))\n            }\n            ShipmentStatus.CONFIRMED -> {\n                ResponseEntity.ok(shipment)\n            }\n            ShipmentStatus.CANCELLED -> {\n                throw ConflictException(\n                    ErrorCode.SHIPMENT_INVALID_STATE_TRANSITION,\n                    \"Cannot confirm a shipment in CANCELLED status\",\n                )\n            }\n        }\n    }\n```\n\nThe method should be inserted before the closing brace of the class. The `list()` method currently ends at line 55, so insert this new method after line 55.\n\nDo NOT modify any existing methods. Only add the new confirm method.\n\nAfter editing, verify the file looks correct by reading it back and confirming the new method was added properly at the end of the class (before the closing brace).","uuid":"7b6386b3-a3da-4ce5-b844-bf4310b6fa88","session_id":"24402fd9-b714-4b41-86f7-6f1d1b0b434b"}
